## 🏗️ Project Components

### 1) CPU designs (`source/design/cpu/`)

- `common/`: Shared modules (ALU, register file) used by both CPU variants
  - `alu.v` - Arithmetic/Logic Unit
  - `register_file.v` - Register bank
- `single_cycle/`: Single-cycle CPU architecture (1 instruction per clock cycle)
  - `cpu_sc.v` - Top-level module
  - `control_unit.v` - Control logic
  - `data_mem.v` - Data memory (separate)
  - `instr_mem.v` - Instruction memory (separate)
  - `ISA/ARCHITECTURE.md` - Instruction set and control signal documentation
- `multi_cycle/`: Multi-cycle CPU architecture (variable cycles per instruction)
  - `cpu_mc.v` - Top-level module
  - `control_unit.v` - FSM-based control logic
  - `memory.v` - Unified memory (shared data/instructions)
  - `ISA/ARCHITECTURE.md` - Instruction set and FSM state documentation

### 2) Practice modules (`source/design/practices/`)

Standalone RTL exercises and utility circuits for digital design learning:
- **Converters**: Binary to/from Gray code, One-hot, One-cold encodings
- **Counters and registers**: `counter.v`, `register.v`, `reg_reset.v`
- **Adders**: Procedural and structural ripple-carry implementations
- **Memory and storage**: `memory.v`, `fifo.v`, `displacer.v`, `displacer_reg.v`
- **Logic**: Multiplexer, driver, controller examples
- **Utilities**: `alu_prac.v` (ALU practice), `lib.v` (common functions), `using_function_counter.v`

### 3) Verification (`source/verif/`)

Testbenches and assembly test programs organized by module:
- `cpu/common/` - Testbenches for shared modules (ALU, register file)
- `cpu/single_cycle/` - Single-cycle CPU testbenches and assembly programs
- `cpu/multi_cycle/` - Multi-cycle CPU testbenches and assembly programs
- `practices/` - Testbenches for practice modules

---

## 📚 CPU-Specific Documentation

Only CPU-specific behavior and test details are documented in dedicated READMEs:

- **Single-cycle CPU**: `source/design/cpu/single_cycle/README.md`
- **Single-cycle architecture**: `source/design/cpu/single_cycle/ISA/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- **Multi-cycle CPU**: `source/design/cpu/multi_cycle/README.md`
- **Multi-cycle architecture**: `source/design/cpu/multi_cycle/ISA/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- **Multi-cycle verification guide**: `source/verif/cpu/multi_cycle/README.md`

