| Tool                 | Purpose                                    |
|----------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| GTKWave              | Waveform visualization                     |
| netlistsvg           | SVG schematic generation from JSON netlist |
| Sky130 liberty files | Technology-specific mapping                |

