## 📄 File Descriptions

### Root scripts

| File       | Description                                  |
|------------|----------------------------------------------|
| `setup.sh` | Environment bootstrap (`.env` generation)     |

### Simulation scripts (`simu/`)

| File               | Description                |
|--------------------|----------------------------|
| `simulate`         | Unified simulation runner  |
| `simu.tcl`         | Legacy TCL script          |

### Synthesis scripts (`synth/`)

| File                | Description                                      |
|---------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| `config.sh`         | Loads config from `.env` / environment variables |
| `check_env.sh`      | Environment checker                              |
| `generic_synth.sh`  | Generic synthesis flow                           |
| `specific_synth.sh` | Sky130-mapped synthesis flow                     |

### Design and verification roots

| Path                        | Description                               |
|-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------|
| `source/design/cpu/`        | CPU RTL (single/multi/common)            |
| `source/design/practices/`  | Practice RTL modules                      |
| `source/verif/cpu/`         | CPU verification (organized by variant)   |
| `source/verif/practices/`   | Practice verification                     |

